    "title": "Week Ten High School Football Play of the Week Winner: Madisonville's Smith brothers - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tyler Shaw ,\n1 days ago MADISONVILLE, Texas (KBTX) - The week ten winner of KBTX’s High School Football Play of the Week comes from two brothers, Carter and Christopher Smith. On a botched snap on a field goal attempt in a game against Bellville, Carter Smith corralled the football and found his brother, Christopner, to pick up the first down. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
